    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "\"let the weight drop\"... i dont even know what that means anymore. i just feel like there's no actual end to it. every time i think i can handle one more thing, another tragedy comes through the doors and it just resets. i'm just so drained. like, is there even a point to keep fighting a losing battle?",
